  "rationale": "Every blocking finding is in a pinned vendor binary (oc, kubectl, roxctl, helm, kn, tkn, opc, skopeo) or in a UBI base RPM the repository reports as not-fixed or wont-fix. None is in Launchpad-authored code, and each pin is the newest version available. The image runs a single-tenant workshop terminal with no inbound service, so exploitation requires an attacker already inside the participant's own shell. Re-signed within 90 days.",
